  "facts": [
    "ServerLevel.getDataStorage delegates to its ServerChunkCache data storage.",
    "ServerChunkCache constructs DimensionDataStorage in storageAccess.getDimensionPath(level.dimension()).resolve(\"data\").",
    "The overworld dimension storage folder is the world root, and LevelResource.ROOT denotes the root resource.",
    "For the shared overworld key journal, server.getWorldPath(LevelResource.ROOT)/data/aia2_key_production_v1.dat is the corresponding file-preservation check. No per-player UUID path is inferred."
  ],
